{
    "title": "Radio FM AM Live Radio Station",
    "description": "Radio FM AM app is free, you don't need to buy FM tuner radio. In the live Radio app, you can choose your favorite local radio station.\r\n\r\nFM Radio\r\n\ud83d\udd35 Functionality\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Set the time and wake up to the sounds of your beloved radio station.\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Turn off at the specified time. Just fall asleep and the next radio will switch off automatically.\r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 Podcasts.\r\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 Save those stations that you love the most to your list of favorites.\r\n5\ufe0f\u20e3 Check the history of the music stations you recently listened to.\r\n\r\nOnline Radio Station\r\n\ud83d\udfe2 Choice of music\r\n\r\n\u2705 The radio player awill allow you to select between stations from all over the world - 97.7 FM, wxpn 88.5 FM, 107.7 radio, 98.5 ktis, 93.1 FM, 92.3 radio, 810 whb, wip 94 1, 104.7 kiss fm, 98.3 FM etc.\r\n\r\n\u2705 It counts over 30,000 radio stations that belong to the following genres:\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Pop\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Hip-hop\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Rock\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Folk\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Latina\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Classical\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Jazz\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Funk\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Retro\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Gospel\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Electronic\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f Lounge\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f and other genres\r\n\r\n\u2705 Live Radio will provide you with concise but exhaustive information about each station. You'll see which country it is from, which language its hosts speak, which genre it specializes in.\r\n\r\nRadioapp\r\n\ud83d\udfe3 Benefits\r\n\ud83d\udfea Local radio is regularly updated.\r\n\ud83d\udfea Its design is sleek with intuitive navigation.\r\n\ud83d\udfea New radio stations are often added to the list.\r\n\ud83d\udfea Its developers always think ahead of the curve and make sure that the simple radio complies with the latest technological standards.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Radio FM AM app is free, you don&#39;t need to buy FM tuner radio. In the live Radio app, you can choose your favorite local radio station.<br><br>FM Radio<br>\ud83d\udd35 Functionality<br>1\ufe0f\u20e3 Set the time and wake up to the sounds of your beloved radio station.<br>2\ufe0f\u20e3 Turn off at the specified time. Just fall asleep and the next radio will switch off automatically.<br>3\ufe0f\u20e3 Podcasts.<br>4\ufe0f\u20e3 Save those stations that you love the most to your list of favorites.<br>5\ufe0f\u20e3 Check the history of the music stations you recently listened to.<br><br>Online Radio Station<br>\ud83d\udfe2 Choice of music<br><br>\u2705 The radio player awill allow you to select between stations from all over the world - 97.7 FM, wxpn 88.5 FM, 107.7 radio, 98.5 ktis, 93.1 FM, 92.3 radio, 810 whb, wip 94 1, 104.7 kiss fm, 98.3 FM etc.<br><br>\u2705 It counts over 30,000 radio stations that belong to the following genres:<br><br>\u2b50\ufe0f Pop<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Hip-hop<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Rock<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Folk<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Latina<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Classical<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Jazz<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Funk<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Retro<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Gospel<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Electronic<br>\u2b50\ufe0f Lounge<br>\u2b50\ufe0f and other genres<br><br>\u2705 Live Radio will provide you with concise but exhaustive information about each station. You&#39;ll see which country it is from, which language its hosts speak, which genre it specializes in.<br><br>Radioapp<br>\ud83d\udfe3 Benefits<br>\ud83d\udfea Local radio is regularly updated.<br>\ud83d\udfea Its design is sleek with intuitive navigation.<br>\ud83d\udfea New radio stations are often added to the list.<br>\ud83d\udfea Its developers always think ahead of the curve and make sure that the simple radio complies with the latest technological standards.",
